# Collapse kubebuilder helm/v2-alpha regen output in GitHub PRs when chart-diff
# has already enforced a byte-for-byte match (diff after kubebuilder + CI seds).
#
# Kubebuilder helm plugin: which files are preserved vs generated
#   https://book.kubebuilder.io/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha
#   (Never overwrites Chart.yaml; preserves values.yaml, NOTES.txt, _helpers.tpl,
#   .helmignore, test-chart.yml unless --force. Chart structure lists crd/, rbac/,
#   manager/, metrics/, etc. vs templates/extras/ for custom resources.)
#
# Excluded from chart-diff: templates/extra/ and templates/extras/ (chart-only;
# kubebuilder may still write into extras/ during edit — diff ignores both).
# Not listed: NOTES.txt, templates/extras/, templates/_helpers.tpl, Chart.yaml,
# values.yaml (see preserved-files note in kubebuilder book link above).
#
# GitHub linguist-generated (PR diff collapse)
#   https://github.com/github/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md
chart/templates/crd/** linguist-generated=true
chart/templates/manager/** linguist-generated=true
chart/templates/metrics/** linguist-generated=true
chart/templates/prometheus/** linguist-generated=true
chart/templates/rbac/** linguist-generated=true
